// DISTINCT (not Whirlpool family): Alliance Laundry, commercial-grade, simple/robust,
// few electronics. No-heat = heating element (electric 240V) or igniter/gas valve coils
// (gas) + thermal limits/thermal fuse. Long-life positioning (qualitative, no invented #).
